### Variable Definition
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001/api/v1/budget

### 1. Valid Full Payload (Expect 200 OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "travellers": 2,
  "days": 4,
  "budget": 25000,
  "transport": { "mode": "train", "totalCost": 3000 },
  "hotel": { "pricePerNight": 2000, "nights": 3 },
  "food": { "pricePerPersonPerDay": 350 },
  "activities": [
    { "name": "Golconda Fort", "pricePerPerson": 25 },
    { "name": "Salar Jung Museum", "pricePerPerson": 50 }
  ],
  "localTransport": { "estimatedCost": 1200 }
}

### 2. Missing Budget (Expect 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "travellers": 2,
  "days": 4,
  "transport": { "mode": "train", "totalCost": 3000 },
  "hotel": { "pricePerNight": 2000, "nights": 3 },
  "food": { "pricePerPersonPerDay": 350 }
}

### 3. Negative Hotel Price (Expect 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "travellers": 2,
  "days": 4,
  "budget": 25000,
  "hotel": { "pricePerNight": -500, "nights": 3 }
}

### 4. Empty Activities Array (Expect 200 OK with activities: 0)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "travellers": 2,
  "days": 4,
  "budget": 25000,
  "transport": { "mode": "flight", "totalCost": 5000 },
  "hotel": { "pricePerNight": 1500, "nights": 3 },
  "activities": []
}

### 5. Over-Budget Scenario (Expect 200 OK with isOverBudget: true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "travellers": 2,
  "days": 5,
  "budget": 10000,
  "hotel": { "pricePerNight": 2500, "nights": 4 },
  "transport": { "totalCost": 4000 }
}
